OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for life for murdering
OL,4,Aestranged wife
OL,5,
OL,6,FTexas-born Williams denied murder but
OL,7,Fwas convicted after a 17-day trial in
OL,8,FAugust and Judge Anthony Bate told the
OL,9,Fkiller he must serve a minimum of 27
OL,10,Fyears before he would be eligible for
OL,11,Fparole.
